l;text-decoration:none\">Belathus</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">RoyalJelly</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">ParadigmOne</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Robynstar</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">描述最后更新于 </span> <span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">2025年8月30日&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">，版本 </span> <span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">2.6</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">请注意，所列功能仅适用于最新版本。旧版本可能无法包含全部功能。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>姐妹模组 -</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/butchercraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;width:253px\"><img style=\"margin-left:0px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/butchercraft.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">让你的动物物尽其用。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/farmers-delight-entaggening-project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;width:253px\"><img style=\"margin-left:0px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/entaggening.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">实现模组间的协同烹饪。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/compendium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;width:253px\"><img style=\"margin-left:0px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/compendium.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">合成：重塑</span></p>\n```",
